{"body":{"model":"opus","reads":{"$ref":"01M6S09BX5DDBXFS8D3EQZG0QR"},"seedFrom":"outside","top":{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4R0T9C21JHHWGVDVN"},"understandings":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4R0T9C21JHHWGVDVN"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4CR0BNKYRTFNYG0JP"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4NW0R08JSHWS49QVK"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4KMGXDT6ZMTWR7XVJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP479BJ20JRK0PF3SWP"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4YFY6FH7YP74N5QQC"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP45YWBFCYX6DEB50R5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP48EJTARHE52R6GH0N"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP47GQ5HK4Q6Z9WWJVX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4YQRW7AXXXQNKA7XJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4PQK6JGXTT4GEC1P5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4N1DQC01H9ENGWEAD"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP40GBV8PSSJJ0XG6ZX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP46JS2DVW1RTCGB19J"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP43JRZR4NZR37K8MHE"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4XWRCCNNJPTJ3CZPE"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4ZA7404TX6MP14G1K"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4DARG83SBMWFCTGF9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4V39HCYV4HE0TF77N"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4RN4A389XJS8VB59B"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP41ESFWPZ6BVNSEWHQ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4T3M2TCAT76FQAXFK"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP44JWBMP6JBWJSWGJG"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4PH7GZYB99GVHBQMV"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4919TTDAW406QVS24"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4DK48D7JE2MPSQTBK"}]},"id":"01M6SD2EP47M3SDHZ4DC7MT693","instance":["01M6S74NG0JR8Q2S499AF7FR71"],"kind":"version","name":"branch-17","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"where coherence is held","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4CR0BNKYRTFNYG0JP"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4YFY6FH7YP74N5QQC"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4PQK6JGXTT4GEC1P5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4ZA7404TX6MP14G1K"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4T3M2TCAT76FQAXFK"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4919TTDAW406QVS24"}],"prose":"Underneath the proposal is one recurring problem: how parts that keep their own logic can still act as one. The paper answers it by relocating where coherence lives, sometimes up in a coordinator, sometimes in meaning agreed for a moment, sometimes in qualities installed as parts, sometimes in a rehearsal of the system by itself.","title":"A whole that keeps moving its center"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4R0T9C21JHHWGVDVN","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"who may decide for whom","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4NW0R08JSHWS49QVK"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4KMGXDT6ZMTWR7XVJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP479BJ20JRK0PF3SWP"}],"prose":"Authority is first placed by rank in a nested pyramid, then said to be spread across levels, then gathered again into a coordinating holon that is called the highest authority yet denied central control.","title":"The address of authority"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4CR0BNKYRTFNYG0JP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"position in the nesting","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08ZK9JNT733QPVPKKPB33"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQJDTPV1K5MVEQB7EKC"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZQKAE5DJFP8AQZCYBJW"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZT4PVPYCGQYJV7PR3M5"}],"prose":"The starting picture: each holon a whole to what it contains and a part to what contains it, its freedom bounded by its position.","title":"Nesting as the given order"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4NW0R08JSHWS49QVK","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"binding without owning","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095E1M1ENNRVMHW352873"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"},{"$ref":"01M6S09710AV583QD1MPBPW32H"},{"$ref":"01M6S0997JNB7G6FJ23GTB226M"},{"$ref":"01M6S099B342ME391EQMJR2ENW"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A5WEFJY26M01RF4RE1F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP44JWBMP6JBWJSWGJG"}],"prose":"The interoperability holon binds every other holon toward an objective and sits atop the use case, while the text insists it leaves each holon's inner logic untouched and replaces no one.","title":"A center that disclaims being one"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4KMGXDT6ZMTWR7XVJ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the route from request to linked elements","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0982Y69VFJ6C8NQBP89NE"},{"$ref":"01M6S098BNS851MZHX3SFT2NYC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098FH9YH6FMBTFF272DJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S098GRA69D8E61BGJ3ETJF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098HDWNMXMGHDKP7HYH0G"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4PH7GZYB99GVHBQMV"}],"prose":"Coordination is made concrete as six parts: one that decides, one that records every element in a graph of possible links, one that translates, one that finds, one that designs a workflow, one that runs it.","title":"The machinery of joining"},"id":"01M6SD2EP44JWBMP6JBWJSWGJG","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the deciding part rests on","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0988S3MZFMVE7H1RCZSJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098ECD82QGT0KGXZG1EAS"}],"prose":"Both the deciding part and the translating part are given to a large language model, for its reasoning and its adaptability to new inputs.","title":"A language model at the core"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4PH7GZYB99GVHBQMV","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much is handed over","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092KE6ZMECGQSSQBF90BV"},{"$ref":"01M6S092MRCB5DHW2QJWZCMH6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S092NT1X7H7BGXEJM161WB"},{"$ref":"01M6S092PS96FXNTYW0G07YCMZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S092QP2J2DR6DJZ6E197EW"},{"$ref":"01M6S0932TYVDNG7V3F9FPTYPQ"},{"$ref":"01M6S098M0RG9CGW3VBAQ8E35X"}],"prose":"Autonomy is never all or nothing: holons range from mere data sources to rule-changers, and stakeholders may remove the coordinator's power to reshape connections, leaving it only to run what exists.","title":"Autonomy as a dial"},"id":"01M6SD2EP479BJ20JRK0PF3SWP","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how long an agreement on meaning lasts","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP45YWBFCYX6DEB50R5"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP48EJTARHE52R6GH0N"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP47GQ5HK4Q6Z9WWJVX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4YQRW7AXXXQNKA7XJ"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4DK48D7JE2MPSQTBK"}],"prose":"Parts that speak differently are joined not by one shared language but by translations negotiated at the moment of meeting, though lasting shared vocabularies and standards keep returning.","title":"Meaning agreed per encounter"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4YFY6FH7YP74N5QQC","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how much sameness is demanded","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095PBA4ZRBXY1GY14VWHR"},{"$ref":"01M6S095Q6V5YHG5EJ40PT2KHP"},{"$ref":"01M6S095RQV1YWJ0PTP40VJPNM"},{"$ref":"01M6S095WN23Y8DRJGK8C24NJV"},{"$ref":"01M6S096NJ1YCGW3GT69CTCK3B"},{"$ref":"01M6S096SSRKHN58F6YBT2PD3S"}],"prose":"One format for all, a common layer above all, or pairwise transformation with neither; the third is chosen because the first two press every participant into the same shape.","title":"Three ways to share meaning"},"id":"01M6SD2EP45YWBFCYX6DEB50R5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the lifespan of a vocabulary","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09654M23DFDXTHS52MBXA"},{"$ref":"01M6S097JQCMENMDG4DXR4V4ZJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097N1AM8EGG88P63ZS8D9"},{"$ref":"01M6S0992KZHB02ZBDX260T244"}],"prose":"Temporary ontologies are built for one task or episode, used, then dropped or revised, so that a newcomer can be understood without prior agreement.","title":"Vocabularies made to be discarded"},"id":"01M6SD2EP48EJTARHE52R6GH0N","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what must not be renegotiated","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08Z79ESR6PT11B13KVPB3"},{"$ref":"01M6S093AKQX05TGPX6C9SX1YG"},{"$ref":"01M6S0941499S7BC44BDW6VFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094DC83NRPYHDHCDK6Z0T"},{"$ref":"01M6S094H6M3N8CRFWQ98BWV6P"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BX3RAPV03PXJHMR2Z5K"}],"prose":"Ethics, bias and understanding are to be encoded in comprehensive, stable ontologies, and future work asks for shared ones, standing against the transient meaning used between holons.","title":"The counter-current of lasting ontologies"},"id":"01M6SD2EP47GQ5HK4Q6Z9WWJVX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether a name stays bound to what it names","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S095GRG93K5EG2K71B1CKV"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HBYZ649HND3ZYXDXYT"},{"$ref":"01M6S095HYCF58A43XBQ8GAQ7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S093C3FHWQ6C5YRWRHZ9BN"},{"$ref":"01M6S093D1G6HQ1AF4PPZ6Z3M4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093QQZ23D7GNGKT5YFGTK"},{"$ref":"01M6S093RJMS7XD707H2868RX0"}],"prose":"In the reading itself, labels and what they denote sometimes come apart: barrier categories carry each other's descriptions, and one dimension's examples repeat another's word for word.","title":"Names loosening from their content"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4YQRW7AXXXQNKA7XJ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what the federation still presupposes","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S092VYEKZR8236TWY9GTNW"},{"$ref":"01M6S096929EE6AD520SWDPK4N"},{"$ref":"01M6S096H49RY8HY208YF1QTMF"},{"$ref":"01M6S098NTTHF9ESCJ8CYMNPR9"},{"$ref":"01M6S098Q89NK293FCZ3EYNTNC"},{"$ref":"01M6S098WFFJ09R57JCXQAZAM3"},{"$ref":"01M6S098YF407XTYGG61RBEPZ7"},{"$ref":"01M6S099046TN4NZCBCFH60P0M"}],"prose":"Though meaning is to be negotiated without uniform standards, standardized protocols, shared formats, security and scale reappear as conditions the federation still depends on.","title":"The standard that keeps returning"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4DK48D7JE2MPSQTBK","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"which capacity is made a part","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4N1DQC01H9ENGWEAD"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP40GBV8PSSJJ0XG6ZX"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP46JS2DVW1RTCGB19J"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP43JRZR4NZR37K8MHE"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4XWRCCNNJPTJ3CZPE"}],"prose":"Capacities one would expect of a whole system, such as conscience, foresight, comprehension, fairness and watchfulness, are each given their own holon, so a virtue becomes a component that can be placed, wired and checked.","title":"Qualities turned into parts"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4PQK6JGXTT4GEC1P5","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the deficit being answered","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0912JT6RA5BZ9DA4QWXW0"},{"$ref":"01M6S0916BHS51YPSAGK594MMT"},{"$ref":"01M6S091HFR7QY67Y0XKA5J0DF"},{"$ref":"01M6S091KTFAT80JBWTQHERM05"}],"prose":"Every quality is introduced as the answer to a named deficit of current autonomous systems.","title":"Each lack summons an organ"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4N1DQC01H9ENGWEAD","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what each quality guards against","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093679WVYX9W76WMQSFYF"},{"$ref":"01M6S093JWWSFCKGZGR3EF21M7"},{"$ref":"01M6S093YQ6AXJZ5BM1HF4WFQX"},{"$ref":"01M6S0949YC2RGE7SVC8VQ2BJA"},{"$ref":"01M6S094NQQR6J9EGV6K49FTZS"}],"prose":"The five qualities, each stated by what goes wrong without it.","title":"Five organs"},"id":"01M6SD2EP40GBV8PSSJJ0XG6ZX","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the flow of checks between qualities","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0950DPJQCE6FKYH7TSD58"},{"$ref":"01M6S0951AZ5JE4ABRCQSXWQ2F"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953BG3WSGDTSRPS30552"},{"$ref":"01M6S0953C5H9DMB8CRTPS6YK3"},{"$ref":"01M6S097S811FX4ENN201BA6PM"},{"$ref":"01M6S097VCBK9XZ25KFJF0ND5N"}],"prose":"The qualities feed and check one another: judgments of right and fairness pass to the one weighing the long term, comprehension informs them, and watchfulness spans all layers; where they conflict, a higher negotiation is called.","title":"Qualities watching qualities"},"id":"01M6SD2EP46JS2DVW1RTCGB19J","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"how qualities combine in one role","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S0974ESZ3BC4PQGRAQ140D"},{"$ref":"01M6S0976Z3XG1JS1A2VTTTBZN"},{"$ref":"01M6S0978GWDT0ZWN8XT22K2EJ"},{"$ref":"01M6S097ZEDYHSVRT1CRE7YFZ3"},{"$ref":"01M6S0981VVD99XQ72EV84VJE6"},{"$ref":"01M6S09A2TPJHK2PYS75HJWY0Y"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AB69C8H307DTGBZQJX3"}],"prose":"In the coordinator and in the mobility case, roles are composites: a traveller holon is an understanding one, a transport holon both fair and effective, orchestrators are called watchful by definition.","title":"One holon wearing several qualities"},"id":"01M6SD2EP43JRZR4NZR37K8MHE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the missing yardstick","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S093FSPTEATFTYCNEJEMQ4"},{"$ref":"01M6S093W4DZ6B9GKDGMNA5DED"},{"$ref":"01M6S09474K3F10PRDVM1JZJ06"},{"$ref":"01M6S094K282XW4C3DANB6FYG7"},{"$ref":"01M6S094XMKX1YC7SH2K1A4ZDZ"}],"prose":"Each quality carries an open problem of definition or measurement: what counts as ethical, how effectiveness is scored, how bias is found as it happens, how awareness is built.","title":"What the qualities cannot yet measure"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4XWRCCNNJPTJ3CZPE","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the relation between a system and its rehearsal","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4DARG83SBMWFCTGF9"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4V39HCYV4HE0TF77N"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP4RN4A389XJS8VB59B"}],"prose":"Simulation is turned inward: the holons become actors in a copy of their own system, and the copy can stop, flag and send findings upward.","title":"The system that rehearses itself"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4ZA7404TX6MP14G1K","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"whether the modelled entity also directs","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S091PP1ZZQG6WZ7R3BMA7Q"},{"$ref":"01M6S091YM28K8SWNXGQD94QWR"},{"$ref":"01M6S092GHEZCKHBE4ZKEW3J78"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RHVP4CPW8DAZR8Q3QP"},{"$ref":"01M6S092RXW7KF4BQKGGRPEJTG"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BPKS0KGT7SR4GE75ACB"}],"prose":"The line runs from agents whose local acts yield unplanned global patterns, to holons that also steer the run that models them.","title":"From emergence to direction"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4DARG83SBMWFCTGF9","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the mirroring of holon and double","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09AH0YMYNDBY3FA44T68F"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AH1PWXPQSYN6X82S0CZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AXT9RAEXAGQP942K710"},{"$ref":"01M6S099RX7Z7ZGC575Z0RX8W5"}],"prose":"Each key holon gets a federate double, including a lesser copy of the coordinator that rules only the simulation while answering to the original.","title":"Twin federates"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4V39HCYV4HE0TF77N","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"what a discrepancy triggers","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S09B0KJPXKB931FZC1JHE3"},{"$ref":"01M6S09B4PEE2MM0G40XAMDENJ"}],"prose":"When a run diverges from normal operation, the place of the fault invalidates the result and passes it up; the run ends in indicators that may restart the whole.","title":"Rehearsal that can refuse"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4RN4A389XJS8VB59B","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"the breadth of domain claimed","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S08YR2M952H7ZN6R90BBJZ"},{"$ref":"01M6S08YV85BZVM4G694CQKMYX"},{"$ref":"01M6S08ZXGVT2TSASGV9X2TYHX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090806VNZVA97AV0V0XD2"},{"$ref":"01M6S090GX8FSDRJ0E4TJ1H3DX"},{"$ref":"01M6S090KZCM15DWJFKQVKT5TM"},{"$ref":"01M6S090PDBF0YZFN6YMV9WJ5W"},{"$ref":"01M6S099CXGHQV3WHYC9KRGE4P"},{"$ref":"01M6SD2EP41ESFWPZ6BVNSEWHQ"}],"prose":"The holon travels from a philosophical notion through factory scheduling to grids, construction and twins, each step widening the domain it is asked to order, and the mobility case is its newest ground.","title":"An idea widening its ground"},"id":"01M6SD2EP4T3M2TCAT76FQAXFK","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
{"body":{"matters":"detecting what is missing","parts":[{"$ref":"01M6S099H77DWSEH2T534Q8NP8"},{"$ref":"01M6S099P1AJBBMKJ6BC76WM36"},{"$ref":"01M6S099QDK964CYS5R06EN4WT"},{"$ref":"01M6S09AG184GYEQ79ZCXADC7B"},{"$ref":"01M6S09BD7Q7DNEGX5EB0MJ8HK"}],"prose":"Beside routing, the mobility system is asked to find absence: places with no transport and zones people avoid, discovered as gaps in the flow of data.","title":"Sensing where nothing is"},"id":"01M6SD2EP41ESFWPZ6BVNSEWHQ","instance":["01M6S74NG13VF3EH1MBDYGSKMZ"],"kind":"version","prev":null}
